 /2026/05/Ella-Mai-in-Concert-at-Smart-Financial-Centre.jpeg
UID:F3qQdPnKGgbNRM2acLfx4
SUMMARY:Ella Mai in Concert at Smart Financial Centre
DTSTAMP:20260802T102128Z
DTSTART:20260805T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Smart Financial Centre welcomes Ella Mai—multi-platinum\, Gramm
	y-winning R&B singer-songwriter—to the Sugar Land stage. \nShe first broke
	 through in 2018 with her chart-dominating single Boo’d Up\, which held th
	e top spot for the most weeks of any song by a woman on the R&B/Hip-Hop Bi
	llboard Airplay chart. \nHer success has earned her a Grammy Award for Bes
	t R&B Song along with  multiple Billboard Music Awards\, iHeartRadio Award
	s\, Soul Train Awards\, an NAACP Image Award\, and a BET Viewers’ Choice A
	ward. \nAma and Girlfriend join the show. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $5
	4. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sp
	onsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and
	 more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, bu
	siness\, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhoust
	on.com/calendar/ella-mai-in-concert-at-smart-financial-centre/\n\nFrom 365
	 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/ella-mai-in-concert-at-smart-fi
	nancial-centre/
LOCATION:Smart Financial Centre at Sugar Land\, 18111 Lexington Blvd\, Suga
	r Land\, TX\, 77479\, United States
